# Digital Bond Landing Page

## Project Overview

Build a production-ready landing page for Digital Bond as part of the Frontend Angular Candidate Assessment.

The goal is to demonstrate senior-level frontend engineering skills by building a fast, accessible, scalable and maintainable application using modern Angular best practices.

The final result should feel like a premium digital agency website while preserving the Digital Bond visual identity.

Do NOT recreate the current website.

Create a completely new modern experience inspired by world-class SaaS and creative agency websites.

